.", "1787097600000 is a large bull trend bar (open 1916.51, high 2293.8, close 2252.16), followed by closes of 2326.32 (1787184000000) and 2515.3 with a 2771 high (1787270400000): a three-bar vertical bull spike.", "From 1787356800000 to 1789603200000 the market holds a 27-bar two-sided range between 2357.18 (1788307200000 low) and 2680 (1789084800000 high), repeatedly rejecting 2520-2557 and 2357-2400 with heavy body overlap.", "1789689600000-1789948800000 breaks above that range and above the 2771 spike high: closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, with the 2850 high at 1789948800000.", "The new high lacks strong follow-through: 1790035200000 is an inside bar and 1790121600000 closes 2684.16 below its open.", "The last seven bars (1790035200000-1790553600000) are overlapping, with the final four trading 2636.28-2740.42 and 1790639999999 closing 2687.88, roughly mid-range and 162 below the 2850 high."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Multi-month bull swing from the 1368.42 low to the 2850 high, with successively higher swing lows (1512.91, 1533.12, 2357.18, 2436.87, 2633.31) across the supplied window.", "end_time_ms": 1790639999999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780704000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Three-bar vertical bull spike following a long two-sided range: open 1916.51 to close 2252.16 (1787097600000), close 2326.32 (1787184000000), then a 2771 high with a 2515.3 close and a large upper tail (1787270400000).", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Twenty-seven-bar two-sided range after the spike: repeated highs 2520-2557 plus the 2680 spike high at 1789084800000, and repeated lows 2357-2400 with 2357.18 at 1788307200000 and 2358.62 at 1789430400000; no sustained close beyond either edge.", "end_time_ms": 1789603200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Four-bar bull breakout above the 27-bar range and above the 2771 spike high, closing near highs at 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9 and 2775.61, with the 2850 high printed at 1789948800000.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Tight seven-bar consolidation just under the 2850 high; the last four bars are small overlapping dojis traded between 2636.28 and 2740.42, with no close beyond the 2612.02 breakout close and final close 2687.88.", "end_time_ms": 1790639999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2786.81 and then 2850 on a trend bar with follow-through, and a higher low above 2633.31, would confirm resumption of the bull channel.", "A bear body closing below 2633.31 and then below the 2612.02 breakout close would suggest the breakout has failed and shift the read toward a trading range or transition-unclear.", "A close below 2436.87 would break the most recent bull swing low and question the always-in-long classification.", "Continued overlapping bars contained between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with no boundary close would keep the current read of a bull trend in a breakout-mode tight range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790668799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The whole window is still a bull structure: 2358.62 low to 2850 high (+20.8%) with higher lows since 1789488000000, so the last 35 bars can equally be read as a bull flag inside a bull trend rather than a topping range.", "The most recent leg is up (low 2636.28 at 1790582400000 to high 2717.28 at the last bar) and the last bar is a bull trend bar closing at 88.6% of its range, so the freshest bars lean long rather than balanced.", "Consecutive strong bull bars 1789732800000 (c 2578.60) and 1789747200000 (c 2636.28), plus the quick recovery from 2636.28, show buyers still absorbing dips inside the range.", "Range boundaries are approximate in behaviour: 2748.23 (1790150400000 high) briefly exceeded the 2740.42 level, so the upper edge of the consolidation is not perfectly clean."], "evidence_for": ["35 consecutive bars trade inside 2633.31-2740.42 with heavy body overlap and no accepted break of either edge, the defining two-sided characteristic of a trading range.", "The last new high was 47 bars ago (2850), and highs since then step down (2804.59, 2786.81, 2740.42, 2721.75, 2717.28); no higher high has been accepted.", "Both edge tests failed: 1790323200000 reached 2740.42 but closed back at 2715.90, and the 1790553600000/1790568000000 break to 2637.00 reversed with 1790582400000 closing back at 2667.86.", "Two climactic bull bars (1789128000000 and 1789977600000) left upper tails of 124.48 and 126.85 and were both retraced, showing sellers at the highs and two-sided trading rather than sustained trend."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars from 1788940800000 to 1790668799999; first close 2500.01, last close 2710.21 (+210.20); window low 2358.62 (1789488000000) and window high 2850 (1789977600000).", "Bar 1789977600000 (o 2658.81, h 2850, l 2658.06, c 2723.15) has a 191.94 range, a 126.85 upper tail and a close in the lower third of its range; no later bar trades above 2804.59.", "Bar 1789128000000 (o 2457.12, h 2680, l 2444.19, c 2555.52) is a 235.81-range spike bar with a 124.48 upper tail and is fully retraced within eight bars.", "After the 2850 high, swing highs step down: 2804.59 (1790020800000), 2786.81 (1